{"id":"db3ed557a2183bff","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees.md","title":"Sacks 分裂的度形式","display":"thm-sacks-splitting-degrees — Sacks 分裂的度形式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees","aliases":["20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees"],"display":"thm-sacks-splitting-degrees — Sacks 分裂的度形式","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Corollary 7.5.3","source_pdf_pages":[193],"source_printed_pages":[159],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]","[[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]","[[20-df-redeg]]","[[20-thm-deg-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-sacks-splitting-degrees</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sacks-splitting-degrees — Sacks 分裂的度形式"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 7.5.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" href=\"?note=9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" title=\"20-thm-sacks-splitting\">20-thm-sacks-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f2d2355efa286b3\" href=\"?note=4f2d2355efa286b3\" title=\"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join\">20-prop-disjoint-ce-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc0aeae8dce11855\" href=\"?note=cc0aeae8dce11855\" title=\"20-thm-deg-join\">20-thm-deg-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\">\\(\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" href=\"?note=9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" title=\"20-thm-sacks-splitting\">20-thm-sacks-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4f2d2355efa286b3\" href=\"?note=4f2d2355efa286b3\" title=\"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join\">20-prop-disjoint-ce-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cc0aeae8dce11855\" href=\"?note=cc0aeae8dce11855\" title=\"20-thm-deg-join\">20-thm-deg-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}degrees}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in L_1\\land\n\\mathbf a_0\\not\\le\\mathbf a_1\\land\\mathbf a_1\\not\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\n\\mathbf b=\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}degrees}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in L_1\\land\n\\mathbf a_0\\not\\le\\mathbf a_1\\land\\mathbf a_1\\not\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\n\\mathbf b=\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取集合形式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=B\">\\(C=B\\)</span>，则两边都严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。若两边可比较，其 join 等于较大的一边，矛盾。此结论是 Sacks 集合分裂的度形式；两个分裂度均为低 c.e. 度，且其 join 等于给定非零 c.e. 度。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 7.5.3；印刷页 159；PDF 第 193 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-sacks-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"9a7da25a4fbbc78c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join","status":"resolved","id":"4f2d2355efa286b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-deg-join","status":"resolved","id":"cc0aeae8dce11855","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-deg-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-sacks-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"9a7da25a4fbbc78c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；see [[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join","status":"resolved","id":"4f2d2355efa286b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；see [[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","hea